        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F60ADD, Contemporary Addison Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional design of Schlage's Addison handleset features a molded edged and square mounts. It has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and will fit door thicknesses from 1-5/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. A grade 1 lock it is made with a rugged all-metal chassis for added security. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/addison-dummy-handleset-schlage-f93add\"><b>Addison Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Addison Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Trim: Handlesets are solid forged brass; wrought brass trim rings with concealed security inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim: are zinc-based plated to match finishes indicated.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable through-bolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Addison Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Range of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 18-1/8\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-3/8\" to 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 12-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-ADD-hand-specification.pdf?v=1704262260\"><b>Schlage Addison Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Addison Single Cylinder Handleset, Schlage F60ADD",
                "description": "Addison Single Cylinder Handleset Schlage F-ADD - The traditional design of Schlage's Addison handleset features a molded edged and square mounts. It has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and will fit door thicknesses from 1-5/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. A grade 1 lock it is made with a rugged all-metal chassis for added security. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.",
                "keywords": "SCH-f60ADD, Schlage addison handlesets, Schlage f60add, schlage single cylinder handlesets, grade 1 handlesets, square handlesets, traditional front door handlesets, traditional handlesets, schlage f series single cylinder handlesets,"
